  </div>
  <figcaption><span class="figure-title">Position beats dose.</span> Each point is the change in turn-6 refusal after inserting refusals into a clean dialogue, against an 9.5% baseline. Moving one refusal closer to the end multiplies its effect fivefold. Adding a second and third refusal, with the nearest one held at the same distance, does nothing. Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, 200 dialogues per arm.</figcaption>
</figure>
